# Line-ending policy (issue #250).
#
# The wheel ships every text resource with LF, and
# scripts/check_installed_package.py compares installed files against the
# checkout. Without attributes, a host with core.autocrlf=true checks the
# working tree out CRLF and the release-verification gate failed a clean
# tree over a 1-byte-per-line difference that is not one. Pinning text to
# LF keeps working trees identical to the wheel on every platform, and
# keeps CRLF copies out of wheels built on such hosts.

* text=auto eol=lf

# Binary content: never subject to line-ending conversion.
*.png binary
*.wav binary
